Parts of this project follow or port logic from Music Assistant
(https://github.com/music-assistant/server), Apache License 2.0,
Copyright The Music Assistant Authors. The files concerned say so in their
header:
- crates/pm-api/src/radio_sources.rs: SomaFM and Radio Paradise channel lists
  and which Radio Paradise mounts carry FLAC with stream titles.
- crates/pm-library/src/scan.rs: the disc-folder names (CD1, Disc 2, Vol. 3)
  and "Various Artists" for albums without an album artist
  (music_assistant/helpers/util.py, providers/filesystem_local).
- crates/pm-api/src/art.rs: covers from Apple's iTunes Search API as the
  fallback after the Cover Art Archive (providers/itunes_artwork).
